        "faq_1": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is a gooseneck kettle used for?",
            "answer": "<p>A gooseneck kettle is used to pour a slow, precise stream of hot water, which makes it ideal for pour-over coffee and matcha. The narrow, curved spout lets you saturate coffee grounds evenly for a balanced extraction, or pour a controlled stream while whisking matcha — and it's a satisfying way to pour anything.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_2": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What's the difference between a gooseneck kettle and a regular electric kettle?",
            "answer": "<p>The main difference is the spout. A regular electric kettle has a standard drip-free spout made for quick, everyday pouring, while a gooseneck kettle has a long, narrow, curved spout that pours a slow, precise stream. That control is what makes a gooseneck ideal for pour-over coffee and matcha, where the way you pour shapes the result. Chefman gooseneck kettles also come in a compact 0.8L size, so they suit solo brewers and small kitchens.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_3": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I use a gooseneck kettle for matcha?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. A gooseneck kettle is great for matcha because the precise stream helps you add water gradually while whisking. Matcha and other delicate green teas taste best with water below a full boil, so a model with temperature presets makes it easy to reach the right heat.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_4": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What size are Chefman gooseneck kettles?",
            "answer": "<p>Chefman gooseneck kettles come in a compact 0.8L capacity, which is roughly 2–4 cups. That personal size is perfect for solo coffee and tea drinkers, small kitchens, and travel, and it heats a single serving quickly.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_5": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do gooseneck kettles have temperature control?",
            "answer": "<p>It depends on the model. Chefman offers a gooseneck for every level — from a simple one-touch boiler to models with temperature presets for dialing in the ideal heat for coffee, matcha, or delicate teas. Check the details on the specific model you're considering.</p>"
          }
        },
